:: pc {"position":"550,975"}
<<scenery pc>>
welcome to your computer.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<slaveEvents BedRoom>>
    <<keyOption [[Leave computer|bed]] 💻>>
    <<keyOption [[Watch porn|watchPorn]] 💗>>: 30min
    <<keyOption [[Shop online|onlineStore]] 🛒>>
    <<keyOption [[Read Doujin/Manga|Manga]] 📚>>
    <<keyOption [[Tor Browser|DarkStore]] 🌐>>
    <<keyOption [[change your name|changenames]]  💬>>
<</unlessEmergency>>\
:: changenames {"position":"675,975"}
<<set _dialogTitle = 'Change ' + $player.name + " name to:";>>\
<<dialog _dialogTitle>>\
    <<textbox '_newName' $player.name>>
    <span id="enterAct">\
        <<button "✅ (Enter) your">>\
            <<run
            if(!$player.originalName)
                $player.originalName = $player.name;
            _mewName = _newName.trim();
            $player.name = _newName ? _newName : $player.originalName;
            Engine.show();
            Dialog.close();
            >>\
        <</button>>\
    </span>\
    <span id="escAct">\
        <<button "❌ (Esc) Cancel">>\
            <<dialogclose>>\
        <</button>>\
    </span>\
    <<run $(document).ready(function(){$('#textbox--newname').focus()})>>\
<</dialog>>
<<include pc>>
:: watchPorn {"position":"575,1125"}
<div style="width:320px;height:320px;border:1px solid #555"><img id="pornMovie"/></div>
What movie do you want to masturbate to?
<<for _movieName range PornMovie.names()>>
    <<print '<<keyAction "'+_movieName+'" 🎬>><<run PornMovie.show("'+_movieName+'")>><</keyAction>>'>>
<</for>>
<<keyOption [[cum|cumstop]] 💦>>
:: cumstop {"position":"800,975"}
<<addMinutes 30>><<run Player.manageEnergy(1)>>\
<<if $player.hasPenis>>\
    <<scenery cumstop>>
<<else>>\
    <<scenery pc>>
<</if>>\
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<keyOption [[Leave computer|bed]] 💻>>
    <<keyOption [[Do something else|pc]] 🔙>>
    <<sleepOption>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\

